# Build artifacts -- reproducible from source (see Makefile for
# DAGREAD.EXE, or plain WSL gcc per README for the native test binaries)
# rather than committed.
*.o
*.exe
*.EXE
test/*
!test/*.c

# Extraction/conversion pipeline intermediates -- regenerable from tools/
# given the UESP XML dump (raw/) and then raw/ itself (converted/). Only
# the final assembled database (dist/UDFP.DAT) is committed -- see README
# for how to reproduce these two steps.
raw/
converted/

# DOSBox local test/deploy sandbox and packaging staging -- personal
# working copies assembled from dist/UDFP.DAT plus a compiled
# DAGREAD.EXE, CWSDPMI.EXE (third-party DPMI host), and screenshot
# captures. Rebuild locally rather than committing; see README.
dosbox_run/
release/
*.zip

# One-off research/dev scratch, not part of the shipped reader or its
# real build pipeline: an earlier considered-and-rejected HTML-output
# prototype (preview/, tools/preview-html.js), a downloaded third-party
# reference sample used only to evaluate that approach (penc-sample/,
# penc1ih.zip -- not ours to redistribute), the saved UESP
# Template:Chart doc and flowchart screenshot used to decode the Main
# Quest diagram's glyphs/topology by hand (template.html, flowchart.png
# -- development reference, not shipped content), ImageMagick crop
# scratch from that same investigation, throwaway iteration on the Main
# Quest diagram generator before it settled into
# tools/main-quest-diagram.js + tools/quest-diagram-helper.js (the two
# tools/convert.js actually requires), and a one-off debug harness
# (src/repcheck.c, not part of the Makefile's real OBJS list).
preview/
penc-sample/
penc1ih.zip
template.html
flowchart.png
crop*.png
tools/preview-html.js
tools/quest-diagram-final.js
tools/quest-diagram-part1.js
tools/quest-diagram-part2.js
tools/quest-diagram-part3.js
tools/quest-diagram-output.txt
src/repcheck.c

# Rolling pre-git backup convention (see memory/backup-before-overwrite)
# -- git itself is the backup mechanism now, this predates it.
backups/

# Editor/OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
